WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.360
Welcome to our training on how to reduce your referral fees in select product categories.

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:10.160
In this video, we'll share how setting a low price for products in certain categories

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:15.520
can help decrease your referral fees and increase your net profits from each sale.

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:20.720
Referral fees for beauty, baby, health, and personal care products are 15%.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:25.680
But when you set the total price of any items in these categories below $10,

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:28.320
you'll only pay an 8% referral fee.

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:34.880
Note that baby products exclude baby apparel but personal care products include personal care

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:35.325
appliances.

00:00:35.325 --> 00:00:42.000
Grocery and gourmet products with a total price at or below $15 are also eligible

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.142
for 8% referral fees instead of 15%.

00:00:45.142 --> 00:00:50.080
This isn't a discount or promotion but rather a lower referral

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:53.488
fee rate for lower priced products in these categories.

00:00:53.488 --> 00:00:55.760
The lower referral fees for these

00:00:55.760 --> 00:01:03.600
categories are available in the US, Canada, Mexico, the UK, Germany, France, Italy, and Spain.

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:08.800
Amazon applies the reduced referral fees to your sales automatically when the total

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:12.320
sales of an item are at or below the price threshold.

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:14.240
This is true for both fulfillment

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:18.287
by Amazon or FBA orders and ones you fulfill yourself.

00:01:18.287 --> 00:01:21.120
Total prices refer to the total amount

00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:26.960
paid by the customer which includes the item price and any shipping or gift wrapping charges

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:28.560
and excludes applicable taxes.

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:32.960
Items that meet the price threshold due to discounts like deals,

00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:37.440
coupons, or promotions are also eligible for reduced referral fees.

00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:41.511
Here's an example of how reduced referral fees work.

00:01:41.511 --> 00:01:45.440
You have a grocery item priced at $15.01

00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:50.720
meaning you pay a referral fee of $2.25 every time you sell the item.

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:57.040
But if you charged customers $15 for the product instead, you'd only pay a referral

00:01:57.040 --> 00:01:59.600
fee of $1.20 for each sale.

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:04.720
In other words, you'd receive 7% of the revenue from that sale

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:06.485
to reinvest in your business.

00:02:06.485 --> 00:02:10.720
If the current total price of your grocery and gourmet products is

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:20.160
between $15.01 and $16.23 in the US, a price adjustment to $15 will increase your net profits

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:20.951
per sale.

00:02:20.951 --> 00:02:22.136
Here's another example.

00:02:22.136 --> 00:02:26.880
Let's say you have a baby, beauty, or health and personal care

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:35.120
product priced at $10.30 meaning you pay a referral fee of $1.55 every time you sell the item.

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:39.760
But if you charged customers $10 for the item instead,

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:45.840
you'd only pay a referral fee of $0.80 for each sale and increase your net profits per sale by
 $

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:46.245
0.44.

00:02:46.245 --> 00:02:52.720
If the current price of your product in baby, beauty, or health and personal care product

00:02:52.720 --> 00:03:02.160
categories is between $10.01 and $10.82 in the US, a price adjustment to $10 will result in

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:04.310
higher net profits per sale.

00:03:04.310 --> 00:03:09.040
To reference a full list of referral fee percentages by category

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:15.280
and total price threshold, search for the referral fees help page in Seller Central and review the

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:16.880
referral fee rate section.

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:22.080
Note that prior approval may be required to offer products in certain categories.

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:29.200
To check your referral fee savings, select the menu icon in the top left corner of Seller Central.

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:32.105
Hover over inventory and select manage inventory.

00:03:32.105 --> 00:03:35.840
If your products are priced at or below the

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:41.440
price thresholds that make your products eligible for a lower referral fee, review these savings

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:44.038
in the estimated fee per unit sold column.

00:03:44.038 --> 00:03:46.960
For example, if your beauty or health and personal

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:54.320
care product is priced at $9.99, you'll see the reduced referral fee when you click the fee preview.

00:03:55.040 --> 00:04:01.120
As a reminder, you'll automatically receive the savings from lower referral fees for all eligible

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:02.350
products and prices.

00:04:02.350 --> 00:04:07.680
You can also download the referral fee preview report to view referral fees

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:10.050
for all items in your catalog.

00:04:10.050 --> 00:04:14.000
To get there, open the main menu, hover over inventory,

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:15.840
and select inventory reports.

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:19.520
When you arrive at the inventory reports page,

00:04:19.520 --> 00:04:25.280
select referral fee preview report from the select report type drop-down menu and click

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:26.070
request report.

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:31.600
This concludes our training on how to reduce your referral fees in select product

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:32.208
categories.

00:04:32.208 --> 00:04:37.680
Thank you and happy selling in the Amazon store.
